    "lrcText": "[al:新概念英语第二册]\n[ar:山海作品推荐]\n[ti:Please Send Me a Card]\n[by:山海作品推荐]\n[00:11.05]How many cards did the writer send? | 作者寄了多少张明信片？\n[00:16.17]Postcards always spoil my holidays. | 明信片总是破坏我的假期。\n[00:21.01]Last summer, I went to Italy. | 去年夏天，我去了意大利。\n[00:24.26]I visited museums and sat in public gardens. | 我参观了博物馆，并坐在公共花园里。\n[00:28.95]A friendly waiter taught me a few words of Italian. | 一位友好的服务员教了我几句意大利语。\n[00:33.45]Then he lent me a book. | 然后他借给我一本书。\n[00:36.10]I read a few lines, but I did not understand a word. | 我读了几行，但一个字也看不懂。\n[00:41.78]Everyday I thought about postcards. | 每天我都想着明信片。\n[00:46.08]My holidays passed quickly, | 我的假期过得很快，\n[00:48.84]but I did not send cards to my friends. | 但我没有给朋友们寄明信片。\n[00:52.98]On the last day I made a big decision. | 在最后一天，我做了一个重大决定。\n[00:57.49]I got up early and bought thirty-seven cards. | 我起得很早，买了三十七张明信片。\n[01:03.08]I spent the whole day in my room, | 我在房间里待了一整天，\n[01:06.55]but I did not write a single card! | 但我一张明信片也没写！",
