    "lrcText": "[al:新概念英语第二册]\n[ar:山海作品推荐]\n[ti:An Exciting Trip]\n[by:山海作品推荐]\n[00:09.85]Why is Tim finding this trip exciting? | 蒂姆为什么觉得这次旅行令人兴奋？\n[00:15.95]I have just received a letter from my brother, Tim. | 我刚收到我哥哥蒂姆的一封信。\n[00:20.73]He is in Australia. | 他在澳大利亚。\n[00:23.12]He has been there for six months. | 他在那里已经六个月了。\n[00:26.50]Tim is an engineer. | 蒂姆是一名工程师。\n[00:28.72]He is working for a big firm and he has already visited | 他在一家大公司工作，并且他已经参观了\n[00:33.45]a great number of different places in Australia. | 澳大利亚的许多不同地方。\n[00:37.61]He has just bought an Australian car and has gone to Alice Springs, | 他刚买了一辆澳大利亚汽车，然后去了爱丽丝泉，\n[00:43.52]a small town in the centre of Australia. | 一个位于澳大利亚中部的小镇。\n[00:47.50]He will soon visit Darwin. | 他很快将参观达尔文。\n[00:50.09]From there, he will fly to Perth. | 从那里，他将飞往珀斯。\n[00:53.81]My brother has never been abroad before, | 我哥哥以前从未出过国，\n[00:57.13]so he is finding this trip very exciting. | 所以他觉得这次旅行非常令人兴奋。",
