    "lrcText": "[al:新概念英语第二册]\n[ar:山海作品推荐]\n[ti:No Wrong Numbers]\n[by:山海作品推荐]\n[00:10.38]What does 'No wrong numbers' mean? | “没有打错的电话”是什么意思？\n[00:15.79]Mr.James Scott has a garage in Silbury | 詹姆斯·斯科特先生在西尔伯里有一家汽车修理厂\n[00:19.91]and now he has just bought another garage in Pinhurst. | 现在他刚刚在平赫斯特又买了一家。\n[00:25.60]Pinhurst is only five miles from Silbury, | 平赫斯特离西尔伯里只有五英里，\n[00:29.72]but Mr. Scott cannot get a telephone for his new garage, | 但斯科特先生无法为他的新修理厂安装电话，\n[00:34.57]so he has just bought twelve pigeons. | 所以他刚买了十二只鸽子。\n[00:38.96]Yesterday, a pigeon carried the first message from Pinhurst to Silbury. | 昨天，一只鸽子把第一封信从平赫斯特带到了西尔伯里。\n[00:45.61]The bird covered the distance in three minutes. | 这只鸟在三分钟内飞完了这段距离。\n[00:49.30]Up to now, | 到目前为止，\n[00:50.86]Mr.Scott has sent a great many requests for spare parts | 斯科特先生已经送出了大量的备件请求\n[00:56.05]and other urgent messages from one garage to the other. | 以及其他紧急信息，从一家修理厂到另一家。\n[01:00.95]In this way, he has begun his own private 'telephone' service. | 通过这种方式，他开创了自己私人的“电话”服务。",
