    "audioUrl": "NCE/NCE2/06.Percy Buttons.mp3",
    "lrcUrl": "NCE/NCE2/06.Percy Buttons.lrc",
    "lrcText": "[al:新概念英语第二册]\n[ar:山海作品推荐]\n[ti:Percy Buttons]\n[by:山海作品推荐]\n[00:10.05]Who is Percy Buttons? | 谁是珀西·巴顿斯？\n[00:14.50]I have just moved to a house in Bridge Street. | 我刚搬到桥街的一所房子里。\n[00:18.76]Yesterday a beggar knocked at my door. | 昨天一个乞丐敲我的门。\n[00:22.36]He asked me for a meal and a glass of beer. | 他向我要一顿饭和一杯啤酒。\n[00:26.54]In return for this, | 作为回报，\n[00:28.41]the beggar stood on his head and sang songs. | 乞丐倒立着唱歌。\n[00:32.87]I gave him a meal. | 我给了他一顿饭。\n[00:35.17]He ate the food and drank the beer. | 他吃了食物，喝了啤酒。\n[00:38.41]Then he put a piece of cheese in his pocket and went away. | 然后他把一块奶酪放进口袋里，走了。\n[00:43.23]Later a neighbour told me about him. | 后来一位邻居告诉我关于他的事。\n[00:46.47]Everybody knows him. | 每个人都认识他。\n[00:48.63]His name is Percy Buttons. | 他的名字叫珀西·巴顿斯。\n[00:51.37]He calls at every house in the street once a month | 他每个月到街上的每家每户拜访一次\n[00:55.39]and always asks for a meal and a glass of beer. | 并且总是要求一顿饭和一杯啤酒。",
