    "lrcText": "[al:新概念英语第二册]\n[ar:山海作品推荐]\n[ti:Too Late]\n[by:山海作品推荐]\n[00:09.23]Did the detectives save the diamonds? | 侦探们保住钻石了吗？\n[00:14.04]The plane was late and detectives were waiting at the airport all morning. | 飞机晚点了，侦探们在机场等了一上午。\n[00:20.38]They were expecting a valuable parcel of diamonds from South Africa. | 他们正在等一个从南非寄来的贵重钻石包裹。\n[00:26.06]A few hours earlier, | 几个小时前，\n[00:28.29]someone had told the police that | 有人告诉警方，\n[00:30.52]thieves would try to steal the diamonds. | 小偷会设法偷走这些钻石。\n[00:34.32]When the plane arrived, | 飞机抵达时，\n[00:36.57]some of the detectives were waiting | 一些侦探在\n[00:38.70]inside the main building | 主楼里等候，\n[00:40.80]while others were waiting on the airfield. | 另一些则在机场跑道上等候。\n[00:44.89]Two men took the parcel off the plane | 两名男子把包裹从飞机上卸下来，\n[00:48.13]and carried it into the Customs House. | 并把它搬进了海关。\n[00:51.80]While two detectives were keeping guard at the door, | 两名侦探在门口守卫，\n[00:55.93]two others opened the parcel. | 另外两名打开了包裹。\n[00:58.93]To their surprise, | 令他们吃惊的是，\n[01:00.98]the precious parcel was full of stones and sand! | 这个贵重包裹里装满了石头和沙子！",
