    "lrcText": "[al:新概念英语第二册]\n[ar:山海作品推荐]\n[ti:A Cold Welcome]\n[by:山海作品推荐]\n[00:09.41]What does 'a cold welcome' refer to? | “冷淡的欢迎”指的是什么？\n[00:15.22]On Wednesday evening, we went to the Town Hall. | 星期三晚上，我们去了市政厅。\n[00:19.29]It was the last day of the year | 那是今年的最后一天，\n[00:21.86]and a large crowd of people had gathered under the Town Hall clock. | 一大群人聚集在市政厅大钟下面。\n[00:27.32]It would strike twelve in twenty minutes' time. | 再过二十分钟，大钟就要敲响十二点了。\n[00:31.52]Fifteen minutes passed and then, | 十五分钟过去了，接着，\n[00:34.22]at five to twelve, the clock stopped. | 在十二点差五分的时候，大钟停了。\n[00:37.85]The big minute hand did not move. | 巨大的分针一动不动。\n[00:40.74]We waited and waited, | 我们等啊等，\n[00:43.35]but nothing happened. | 但什么也没有发生。\n[00:45.14]Suddenly someone shouted. | 突然有人喊道：\n[00:47.69]'It's two minutes past twelve! | “已经十二点过两分了！\n[00:50.72]The clock has stopped!' | 大钟停了！”\n[00:53.03]I looked at my watch. | 我看了看我的表。\n[00:54.70]It was true. | 果然如此。\n[00:56.43]The big clock refused to welcome the New Year. | 那座大钟拒不迎接新年。\n[01:00.66]At that moment, everybody began to laugh and sing. | 就在那一刻，所有人都开始笑啊唱啊。",
