    "lrcText": "[al:新概念英语第二册]\n[ar:山海作品推荐]\n[ti:Goodbye and Good Luck]\n[by:山海作品推荐]\n[00:10.64]Where is Captain Alison going and how? | 艾莉森船长要去哪里，怎么去？\n[00:16.15]Our neighbour, Captain Charles Alison, will sail from Portsmouth tomorrow. | 我们的邻居，查尔斯·艾莉森船长，明天将从朴茨茅斯启航。\n[00:23.68]We'll meet him at the harbour early in the morning. | 我们明天一早将在港口与他会合。\n[00:27.51]He will be in his small boat, Topsail. | 他将乘坐他的小船“上帆号”。\n[00:31.64]Topsail is a famous little boat. | “上帆号”是一艘著名的小船。\n[00:34.97]It has sailed across the Atlantic many times. | 它已经多次横渡大西洋。\n[00:39.48]Captain Alison will set out at eight o'clock, | 艾莉森船长将在八点钟出发，\n[00:43.04]so we'll have plenty of time. | 所以我们有充足的时间。\n[00:46.00]We'll see his boat and then we'll say goodbye to him. | 我们将去看他的船，然后向他告别。\n[00:50.16]He will be away for two months. | 他将离开两个月。\n[00:53.09]We are very proud of him. | 我们为他感到非常自豪。\n[00:55.91]He will take part in an important race across the Atlantic. | 他将参加一场重要的横渡大西洋的比赛。",
