    "lrcText": "[al:新概念英语第二册]\n[ar:山海作品推荐]\n[ti:The Greenwood Boys]\n[by:山海作品推荐]\n[00:09.99]Why will the police have a difficult time? | 警察为什么会遇到困难？\n[00:15.28]The Greenwood Boys are a group of pop singers. | “格林伍德少年”是一个流行歌手组合。\n[00:19.38]At present, they are visiting all parts of the country. | 目前，他们正在全国各地巡回演出。\n[00:24.48]They will be arriving here tomorrow. | 他们明天将抵达这里。\n[00:27.76]They will be coming by train and most of the young people in the town will be meeting them at the station. | 他们将乘火车来，镇上的大部分年轻人会去车站迎接他们。\n[00:35.81]Tomorrow evening they will be singing at the Workers' Club. | 明天晚上，他们将在工人俱乐部演唱。\n[00:40.82]The Greenwood Boys will be staying for five days. | “格林伍德少年”将停留5天。\n[00:45.24]During this time, they will give five performances. | 在此期间，他们将演出5场。\n[00:50.16]As usual, the police will have a difficult time. | 和往常一样，警察将遇到很多麻烦。\n[00:54.70]They will be trying to keep order. | 他们将尽力维持秩序。\n[00:57.56]It is always the same on these occasions. | 每逢这种场合，情况总是如此。",
