    "lrcText": "[al:新概念英语第二册]\n[ar:山海作品推荐]\n[ti:Do You Speak English?]\n[by:山海作品推荐]\n[00:10.47]Did the young man speak English? | 那个年轻人会说英语吗？\n[00:15.27]I had an amusing experience last year. | 去年我有一个有趣的经历。\n[00:19.24]After I had left a small village in the south of France, | 在我离开法国南部的一个小村庄后，\n[00:23.47]I drove on to the next town. | 我驱车前往下一个城镇。\n[00:26.82]On the way, a young man waved to me. | 在路上，一个年轻人向我招手。\n[00:30.58]I stopped and he asked me for a lift. | 我停了下来，他请求我搭他一程。\n[00:34.62]As soon as he had got into the car, | 他一上车，\n[00:37.90]I said good morning to him in French and he replied in the same language. | 我就用法语向他问好，他也用同样的语言回答我。\n[00:44.36]Apart from a few words, | 除了一些词语，\n[00:46.65]I do not know any French at all. | 我一点法语也不会。\n[00:50.17]Neither of us spoke during the journey. | 在旅途中，我们两人都没有说话。\n[00:53.32]I had nearly reached the town, when the young man suddenly said, very slowly, | 我快到城镇时，那个年轻人突然非常缓慢地说，\n[01:00.63]'Do you speak English?' | “你会说英语吗？”\n[01:04.63]As I soon learnt, he was English himself! | 我很快了解到，他自己就是英国人！",
