    "lrcUrl": "NCE/NCE2/18.He Often does This.lrc",
    "lrcText": "[al:新概念英语第二册]\n[ar:山海作品推荐]\n[ti:He Often does This]\n[by:山海作品推荐]\n[00:09.56]What had happened to the writer's bag? | 作家的包怎么了？\n[00:14.28]After I had had lunch at a village pub, I looked for my bag. | 我在一家乡村酒吧吃过午饭后，就去找我的包。\n[00:20.98]I had left it on a chair beside the door and now it wasn't there! | 我把它放在门旁边的一把椅子上，现在它不在那里了！\n[00:27.45]As I was looking for it, the landlord came in. | 当我正在找它的时候，房东进来了。\n[00:32.45]'Did you have a good meal?' he asked. | “你吃得好吗？”他问。\n[00:35.94]'Yes, thank you,' I answered, 'but I can't pay the bill. I haven't got my bag.' | “是的，谢谢你，”我回答说，“但我付不了账单。我没有我的包。”\n[00:44.30]The landlord smiled and immediately went out. | 房东笑了，立刻出去了。\n[00:48.80]In a few minutes he returned with my bag and gave it back to me. | 几分钟后，他带着我的包回来了，并把它还给了我。\n[00:54.93]'I'm very sorry,' he said. | “我非常抱歉，”他说。\n[00:58.43]'My dog had taken it into the garden. He often does this!' | “我的狗把它叼到花园里去了。它经常这样做！”",
