    "lrcText": "[al:新概念英语第二册]\n[ar:山海作品推荐]\n[ti:Sold Out]\n[by:山海作品推荐]\n[00:10.20]When will the writer see the play? | 作者什么时候会看这部戏？\n[00:15.14]'The play may begin at any moment,' I said. | “这出戏随时都可能开始，”我说。\n[00:19.47]'It may have begun already,' Susan answered. | “可能已经开始了，”苏珊回答说。\n[00:24.55]I hurried to the ticket office. | 我赶紧跑到售票处。\n[00:27.78]'May I have two tickets please?' I asked. | “请给我两张票好吗？”我问道。\n[00:32.35]'I'm sorry, we've sold out,' the girl said. | “对不起，票已经卖完了，”那个女孩说。\n[00:37.10]'What a pity!' Susan exclaimed. | “真可惜！”苏珊惊呼道。\n[00:41.51]Just then, a man hurried to the ticket office. | 就在那时，一个男人匆匆跑到售票处。\n[00:46.59]'Can I return these two tickets?' he asked. | “我能退这两张票吗？”他问道。\n[00:51.15]'Certainly,' the girl said. | “当然可以，”那个女孩说。\n[00:55.05]I went back to the ticket office at once. | 我立刻回到了售票处。\n[00:59.44]'Could I have those two tickets please?' I asked. | “我能要那两张票吗？”我问道。\n[01:05.21]'Certainly,' the girl said, | “当然可以，”那个女孩说，\n[01:08.69]'but they're for next Wednesday's performance. | “但那是下周三演出的票。\n[01:12.40]Do you still want them?' | 你还要吗？”\n[01:15.35]'I might as well have them,' I said sadly. | “我还是把它们拿走吧，”我伤心地说。",
