    "lrcText": "[al:新概念英语第二册]\n[ar:山海作品推荐]\n[ti:A New House]\n[by:山海作品推荐]\n[00:10.53]Why is the new house special? | 这新房子有什么特别之处？\n[00:15.29]I had a letter from my sister yesterday. | 昨天我收到了我姐姐的一封信。\n[00:19.23]She lives in Nigeria. | 她住在尼日利亚。\n[00:22.23]In her letter, she said that she would come to England next year. | 在信中她说她明年将来英国。\n[00:28.38]If she comes, she will get a surprise. | 如果她来了，她会大吃一惊的。\n[00:32.58]We are now living in a beautiful new house in the country. | 我们现在正住在这乡下一所漂亮的新房子里。\n[00:37.85]Work on it had begun before my sister left. | 这所房子的建造在我姐姐离开之前就动工了。\n[00:42.58]The house was completed five months ago. | 房子在5个月前就竣工了。\n[00:46.50]In my letter, I told her that she could stay with us. | 我在信中告诉她，她可以和我们住在一起。\n[00:51.52]The house has many large rooms and there is a lovely garden. | 这所房子有许多大房间，还有一个漂亮的花园。\n[00:57.35]It is a very modern house, so it looks strange to some people. | 这是一座很现代化的房子，所以有些人觉得它样子很怪。\n[01:03.69]It must be the only modern house in the district. | 它肯定是这个地区唯一的一座现代化住宅。",
