    "lrcUrl": "NCE/NCE2/25.Do the English Speak English.lrc",
    "lrcText": "[al:新概念英语第二册]\n[ar:山海作品推荐]\n[ti:Do the English Speak English?]\n[by:山海作品推荐]\n[00:03.30]Do they speak English? | 他们说英语吗？\n[00:12.26]Why does the writer not understand the porter? | 为什么作者听不懂搬运工的话？\n[00:17.71]I arrived in London at last. | 我终于抵达伦敦了。\n[00:21.05]The railway station was big, black and dark. | 火车站又大，又黑，又暗。\n[00:26.35]I did not know the way to my hotel, so I asked a porter. | 我不知道去旅馆的路，所以我问了一位搬运工。\n[00:32.60]I not only spoke English very carefully, but very clearly as well. | 我不仅非常仔细地说英语，而且说得非常清楚。\n[00:40.16]The porter, however, could not understand me. | 然而，那个搬运工却听不懂我。\n[00:44.44]I repeated my question several times and at last he understood. | 我重复了我的问题好几次，最后他终于明白了。\n[00:51.37]he answered me, but he spoke neither slowly nor clearly. | 他回答了我，但他既说得不慢也不清楚。\n[00:57.42]'I am a foreigner,' I said. | “我是一个外国人，”我说。\n[01:01.12]Then he spoke slowly, but I could not understand him. | 然后他慢慢地说，但我仍然听不懂他。\n[01:07.15]My teacher never spoke English like that! | 我的老师从来没有那样说过英语！\n[01:11.68]The porter and I looked at each other and smiled. | 搬运工和我互相对视，然后笑了。\n[01:15.91]Then he said something and I understood it. | 然后他说了一些话，我听懂了。\n[01:20.14]'You'll soon learn English!' he said. | “你很快就会学好英语的！”他说。\n[01:24.32]I wonder. | 我怀疑。\n[01:26.53]In England, each person speaks a different language. | 在英国，每个人都说着不同的语言。\n[01:31.50]The English understand each other, but I don't understand them! | 英国人彼此听得懂，但我听不懂他们！",
