    "lrcText": "[al:新概念英语第二册]\n[ar:山海作品推荐]\n[ti:A Wet Night]\n[by:山海作品推荐]\n[00:10.29]What happened to the boys in the night? | 晚上男孩们发生了什么事？\n[00:15.08]Late in the afternoon, the boys put up their tent in the middle of a field. | 下午很晚的时候，男孩们把帐篷搭在了田野中央。\n[00:21.85]As soon as this was done, they cooked a meal over an open fire. | 这一切刚弄好，他们就在篝火上做了一顿饭。\n[00:27.98]They were all hungry and the food smelled good. | 他们都饿了，食物闻起来很香。\n[00:32.99]After a wonderful meal, they told stories and sang songs by the campfire. | 美餐一顿之后，他们围着篝火讲故事，唱歌。\n[00:40.91]But some time later it began to rain. | 但过了一会儿，天开始下雨了。\n[00:44.71]The boys felt tired so they put out the fire and crept into their tent. | 男孩们感到疲倦了，于是他们熄灭了篝火，钻进了帐篷。\n[00:51.47]Their sleeping bags were warm and comfortable, so they all slept soundly. | 他们的睡袋又暖和又舒服，所以他们都睡得很香。\n[00:58.66]In the middle of the night, two boys woke up and began shouting. | 半夜里，两个男孩醒了，开始大叫起来。\n[01:04.55]The tent was full of water! | 帐篷里全是水！\n[01:07.56]They all leapt out of their sleeping bags and hurried outside. | 他们都跳出睡袋，匆匆忙忙跑到了外面。\n[01:13.65]It was raining heavily and they found that a stream had formed in the field. | 雨下得很大，他们发现田野里形成了一条小溪。\n[01:20.09]The stream wound its way across the field and then flowed right under their tent! | 小溪蜿蜒穿过田野，然后正好从他们的帐篷下面流过！",
