    "lrcText": "[al:新概念英语第二册]\n[ar:山海作品推荐]\n[ti:Taxi]\n[by:山海作品推荐]\n[00:09.28]Does Captain Fawcett think any trip is too dangerous? | 福西特上尉认为有哪次飞行会太危险吗？\n[00:15.69]Captain Ben Fawcett has bought an unusual taxi and has begun a new service. | 本·福西特上尉购买了一架不同寻常的“出租车”，并开始了一项新业务。\n[00:23.34]The 'taxi' is a small Swiss aeroplane called a 'Pilatus Porter'. | 这架“出租车”是一架名为“皮拉图斯搬运工”的瑞士小型飞机。\n[00:29.69]This wonderful plane can carry seven passengers. | 这架奇妙的飞机能载七名乘客。\n[00:34.40]The most surprising thing about it, however, is that it can land anywhere: on snow, water, or even on a ploughed field. | 然而，它最令人惊讶的地方是它能降落在任何地方：雪地、水面，甚至是一块耕过的田地。\n[00:47.11]Captain Fawcett's first passenger was a doctor who flew from Birmingham to a lonely village in the Welsh mountains. | 福西特上尉的第一位乘客是一位医生，他从伯明翰飞到威尔士山区的一个偏僻村庄。\n[00:56.89]Since then, Captain Fawcett has flown passengers to many unusual places. | 从那以后，福西特上尉已载送乘客去过许多不寻常的地方。\n[01:04.48]Once he landed on the roof of a block of flats and on another occasion, he landed in a deserted car park. | 他曾有一次降落在公寓楼的屋顶上，还有一次降落在废弃的停车场里。\n[01:14.86]Captain Fawcett has just refused a strange request from a businessman. | 福西特上尉刚刚拒绝了一位商人提出的一个奇怪请求。\n[01:21.17]The man wanted to fly to Rockall, a lonely island in the Atlantic Ocean, | 那位商人想飞到大西洋中的一座孤岛——罗科尔岛，\n[01:28.27]but Captain Fawcett did not take him because the trip was too dangerous. | 但福西特上尉没有载他，因为那次飞行太危险了。",
