    "lrcText": "[al:新概念英语第二册]\n[ar:山海作品推荐]\n[ti:Success Story]\n[by:山海作品推荐]\n[00:10.09]What was Frank's first job? | 弗兰克的第一个工作是什么？\n[00:14.48]Yesterday afternoon Frank Hawkins was telling me about | 昨天下午，弗兰克·霍金斯正在给我讲\n[00:19.08]his experiences as a young man. | 他年轻时的经历。\n[00:23.07]Before he retired, | 在他退休之前，\n[00:25.39]Frank was the head of | 弗兰克是一家\n[00:26.96]a very large business company, but as a boy he used to work in a small shop. | 非常大的商业公司的负责人，但小时候他曾在一家小商店工作。\n[00:34.44]It was his job to repair bicycles | 他的工作是修理自行车，\n[00:37.50]and at that time he used to work fourteen hours a day. | 那时候他每天工作十四个小时。\n[00:42.98]He saved money for years and | 他攒了好几年的钱，\n[00:45.37]in 1958 he bought a small workshop of his own. | 1958年他买下了一间自己的小作坊。\n[00:50.77]In his twenties Frank used to make spare parts for aeroplanes. | 二十多岁时，弗兰克曾为飞机制造备件。\n[00:56.63]At that time he had two helpers. | 那时候他有两个助手。\n[01:00.18]In a few years the small workshop had become a large factory | 几年之内，这个小作坊就变成了一家大工厂，\n[01:05.56]which employed seven hundred and twenty-eight people. | 雇佣了七百二十八名工人。\n[01:10.63]Frank smiled when he remembered his hard early years and the long road to success. | 弗兰克回忆起他艰难的早年和漫长的成功之路时笑了。\n[01:18.24]He was still smiling when the door opened and his wife came in. | 门开了，他妻子走进来的时候，他还在笑。\n[01:23.59]She wanted him to repair their grandson's bicycle! | 她想让他修理他们孙子的自行车！",
