    "lrcText": "[al:新概念英语第二册]\n[ar:山海作品推荐]\n[ti:Out of the Darkness]\n[by:山海作品推荐]\n[00:10.68]Why was the girl in hospital? | 女孩为什么住院了？\n[00:14.62]Nearly a week passed before | 将近一个星期过去了\n[00:16.96]the girl was able to explain | 女孩才能解释\n[00:19.54]what had happened to her. | 发生在她身上的事情。\n[00:23.15]One afternoon she set out | 一个下午，她出发了\n[00:25.70]from the coast in a small boat | 乘小船从海岸出发\n[00:28.22]and was caught in a storm. | 结果遭遇了暴风雨。\n[00:31.49]Towards evening, | 傍晚时分，\n[00:33.09]the boat struck a rock and | 小船撞上了一块礁石\n[00:35.13]the girl jumped into the sea. | 女孩跳入了海中。\n[00:38.30]Then she swam to the shore | 然后她游向岸边\n[00:40.63]after spending the whole night in the water. | 在水里待了一整夜。\n[00:44.71]During that time she covered | 在那段时间里，她游了\n[00:47.50]a distance of eight miles. | 八英里的距离。\n[00:50.81]Early next morning, | 第二天一早，\n[00:52.90]she saw a light ahead. | 她看到前方有灯光。\n[00:55.80]She knew she was near the shore | 她知道她靠近岸边了\n[00:58.90]because the light was high up on the cliffs. | 因为灯光在高高的悬崖上。\n[01:03.51]On arriving at the shore, | 到达岸边后，\n[01:06.16]the girl struggled up the cliff towards | 女孩艰难地爬上悬崖\n[01:09.56]the light she had seen. | 朝着她看到的灯光。\n[01:12.09]That was all she remembered. | 这就是她所记得的一切。\n[01:15.17]When she woke up a day later, | 一天后她醒来时，\n[01:17.97]she found herself in hospital. | 她发现自己躺在医院里。",
