    "lrcText": "[al:新概念英语第二册]\n[ar:山海作品推荐]\n[ti:Stop Thief!]\n[by:山海作品推荐]\n[00:11.67]How did Roy stop the thieves? | 罗伊是怎样制止小偷的？\n[00:16.41]Roy Trenton used to drive a taxi. | 罗伊·特伦顿以前是开出租车的。\n[00:20.62]A short while ago, however, | 然而，不久前，\n[00:23.65]he became a bus driver | 他当上了一名公共汽车司机，\n[00:25.93]and he has not regretted it. | 他一点也不后悔。\n[00:29.27]He is finding his new work far more exciting. | 他觉得自己的新工作更加激动人心。\n[00:34.53]When he was driving | 最近，当他开着车\n[00:35.75]along Catford Street recently, | 沿卡特福德大街行驶时，\n[00:38.95]he saw two thieves rush out of a shop | 他看见两个小偷从一家商店里冲出来，\n[00:43.02]and run towards a waiting car. | 朝一辆等在那里的汽车跑去。\n[00:46.37]One of them was carrying a bag full of money. | 其中一个提着一满袋钱。\n[00:51.24]Roy acted quickly and drove the bus | 罗伊迅速行动，\n[00:54.46]straight at the thieves. | 把公共汽车径直朝小偷开去。\n[00:57.29]The one with the money got such a fright | 拿钱的那个小偷吓了一大跳，\n[01:00.67]that he dropped the bag. | 把袋子都弄掉了。\n[01:03.25]As the thieves were trying to get away in their car, | 当小偷们试图乘车逃跑时，\n[01:07.60]Roy drove his bus into the back of it. | 罗伊开着公共汽车撞在小偷汽车的尾部。\n[01:11.89]While the battered car was moving away, | 就在那辆被撞坏的汽车开走的时候，\n[01:15.46]Roy stopped his bus and telephoned the police. | 罗伊停下公共汽车给警察打了电话。\n[01:19.33]The thieves' car was badly damaged and easy to recognize. | 小偷的汽车已严重受损，很容易辨认。\n[01:25.05]Shortly afterwards, | 不久，\n[01:27.27]the police stopped the car and both men were arrested. | 警察截住了那辆汽车，两名男子都被捕了。",
