    "lrcText": "[al:新概念英语第二册]\n[ar:山海作品推荐]\n[ti:Everything Except the Weather]\n[by:山海作品推荐]\n[00:10.98]Why did Harrison sell his house so quickly? | 为什么哈里森把房子卖得这么快？\n[00:16.51]My old friend, Harrison, had lived in | 我的老朋友哈里森在\n[00:20.00]the Mediterranean for many years | 地中海地区住过多年，\n[00:22.65]before he returned to England. | 然后才回到英国。\n[00:25.97]He had often dreamed of retiring in England | 他曾常常梦想在英国退休，\n[00:29.89]and had planned to settle down in the country. | 并计划在乡村安顿下来。\n[00:33.61]He had no sooner returned than he bought | 他刚一回来就买下\n[00:37.38]a house and went to live there. | 了所房子住了进去。\n[00:40.05]Almost immediately he began to complain | 他几乎是立刻就开始抱怨\n[00:43.62]about the weather, | 天气了，\n[00:45.62]for even though it was still summer, | 因为尽管当时仍是夏天，\n[00:49.20]it rained continually and it was often bitterly cold. | 但却一直下雨，而且常常冷得厉害。\n[00:54.84]After so many years of sunshine, | 在阳光充足的地方生活了那么多年之后，\n[00:57.84]Harrison got a shock. | 哈里森感到很震惊。\n[01:00.47]He acted as if he had never lived in England before. | 他的举动就好像他以前从未在英国生活过一样。\n[01:05.60]In the end, it was more than he could bear. | 最终，他再也忍受不了了。\n[01:09.79]He had hardly had time to settle down | 他还没来得及安顿下来，\n[01:13.04]when he sold the house and left the country. | 就把房子卖掉离开了英国。\n[01:17.21]The dream he had had for so many years ended there. | 他多年的梦想就这样破灭了。\n[01:22.79]Harrison had thought of everything except the weather. | 哈里森把什么都考虑到了，就是没想到天气。",
