    "audioUrl": "NCE/NCE2/40.Food and Talk.mp3",
    "lrcUrl": "NCE/NCE2/40.Food and Talk.lrc",
    "lrcText": "[al:新概念英语第二册]\n[ar:山海作品推荐]\n[ti:Food and Talk]\n[by:山海作品推荐]\n[00:09.79]Was Mrs. Rumbold a good companion at dinner? | 伦布尔德夫人是个好的晚餐伴侣吗？\n[00:15.06]Last week at a dinner party, | 上周在一个晚宴上，\n[00:17.55]the hostess asked me to sit next to Mrs. Rumbold. | 女主人请我坐在伦布尔德夫人旁边。\n[00:22.74]Mrs. Rumbold was a large, | 伦布尔德夫人是个身材魁梧、\n[00:24.99]unsmiling lady in a tight black dress. | 不苟言笑的女士，穿着一件紧身黑连衣裙。\n[00:29.34]She did not even look up when I took my seat beside her. | 我在她身边坐下时，她甚至没有抬头看我。\n[00:34.73]Her eyes were fixed on her plate and in a short time, | 她的眼睛盯着自己的盘子，不一会儿，\n[00:39.22]she was busy eating. | 她就开始大吃起来。\n[00:42.09]I tried to make conversation. | 我试图和她攀谈。\n[00:44.95]'A new play is coming to \"The Globe\" soon,' | “一部新戏很快就要在‘环球剧场’上演了，”\n[00:48.27]I said. 'Will you be seeing it?' | 我说，“您会去看吗？”\n[00:53.12]'No,' she answered. | “不，”她答道。\n[00:55.95]'Will you be spending your holidays abroad this year?' I asked. | “今年您会到国外度假吗？”我问。\n[01:03.23]'No,' she answered. | “不，”她答道。\n[01:05.81]'Will you be staying in England?' I asked. | “您会留在英格兰吗？”我问。\n[01:09.92]'No,' she answered. | “不，”她答道。\n[01:12.94]In despair, I asked her whether she was enjoying her dinner. | 绝望中，我问她是否喜欢她的晚餐。\n[01:18.50]'Young man,' she answered, | “年轻人，”她回答说，\n[01:21.70]'if you ate more and talked less, we would both enjoy our dinner!' | “如果你多吃点，少说点，我们俩都会享受晚餐的！”",
