    "lrcText": "[al:新概念英语第二册]\n[ar:山海作品推荐]\n[ti:Over the South Pole]\n[by:山海作品推荐]\n[00:10.69]How was the plane able to clear the mountains? | 飞机是如何能够越过山脉的？\n[00:15.88]In 1929, three years after his flight over the North Pole, | 1929年，在他飞越北极三年后，\n[00:22.78]the American explorer, R.E. Byrd, | 美国探险家R.E.伯德，\n[00:27.04]successfully flew over the South Pole for the first time. | 首次成功飞越了南极。\n[00:32.03]Though, at first, Byrd and his men were able to take a | 虽然起初，伯德和他的队员们能够拍摄到\n[00:37.06]great many photographs of the mountains that lay below, | 许多下方山脉的照片，\n[00:42.09]they soon ran into serious trouble. | 但他们很快就遇到了严重的麻烦。\n[00:46.01]At one point, it seemed certain that their plane would crash. | 有一刻，他们的飞机似乎肯定会坠毁。\n[00:51.39]It could only get over the mountains if it rose to 10, 000 feet. | 只有当飞机上升到10,000英尺时，才能越过山脉。\n[00:57.71]Byrd at once ordered his men to throw out two heavy food sacks. | 伯德立即命令他的队员们扔掉两个沉重的食物袋。\n[01:04.15]The plane was then able to rise and it cleared the mountains by 400 feet. | 飞机随后得以升高，并以400英尺的高度越过了山脉。\n[01:11.03]Byrd now knew that he would be able to reach the South Pole which was 300 miles away, | 伯德现在知道他将能够抵达300英里外的南极，\n[01:18.78]for there were no more mountains in sight. | 因为视线中没有更多的山脉了。\n[01:22.53]The aircraft was able to fly over the endless white plains without difficulty. | 飞机能够毫不费力地飞越无尽的白色平原。",
