    "lrcText": "[al:新概念英语第二册]\n[ar:山海作品推荐]\n[ti:A Clear Conscience]\n[by:山海作品推荐]\n[00:10.18]How did Sam get his money back? | 萨姆是怎么把钱找回来的？\n[00:14.70]The whole village soon learnt that a large sum of money had been lost. | 整个村子很快就知道一大笔钱丢了。\n[00:21.01]Sam Benton, the local butcher, | 当地屠夫萨姆·本顿\n[00:24.33]had lost his wallet while taking his savings to the post office. | 在去邮局存钱的路上丢了钱包。\n[00:30.29]Sam was sure that the wallet must have been found by one of the villagers, | 萨姆确信钱包一定是被村里人捡走了，\n[00:36.74]but it was not returned to him. | 但一直没有还给他。\n[00:40.43]Three months passed, and then one morning, Sam found his wallet outside his front door. | 三个月过去了，一天早上，萨姆在自家门外发现了他的钱包。\n[00:49.07]It had been wrapped up in newspaper and it contained half the money he had lost, | 钱包用报纸包着，里面有他丢失的一半钱，\n[00:56.09]together with a note which said: | 还有一张纸条，上面写着：\n[00:59.06]'A thief, yes, but only 50 per cent a thief!' | “我是个小偷，但只算50%的小偷！”\n[01:05.13]Two months later, | 两个月后，\n[01:06.81]some more money was sent to Sam with another note: | 又有一些钱连同另一张纸条寄给了萨姆：\n[01:12.12]'Only 25 per cent a thief now!' | “现在我只算25%的小偷了！”\n[01:16.32]In time, all Sam's money was paid back in this way. | 渐渐地，萨姆所有的钱都以这种方式还了回来。\n[01:22.34]The last note said: 'I am 100 per cent honest now!' | 最后一张纸条写着：“我现在是100%的诚实人！”",
