    "lrcText": "[al:新概念英语第二册]\n[ar:山海作品推荐]\n[ti:Expensive and Uncomfortable]\n[by:山海作品推荐]\n[00:11.39]What did the man in this story do? | 这个故事里的男人做了什么？\n[00:16.15]When a plane from London arrived at Sydney airport, | 当一架从伦敦起飞的飞机抵达悉尼机场时，\n[00:20.66]workers began to unload a number of wooden boxes which contained clothing. | 工人们开始卸下一些装有衣服的木箱。\n[00:27.95]No one could account for the fact that one of the boxes was extremely heavy. | 没有人能解释其中一个箱子异常沉重的原因。\n[00:35.42]It suddenly occurred to one of the workers to open up the box. | 其中一个工人突然想到要打开那个箱子。\n[00:41.62]He was astonished at what he found. | 他对自己的发现感到震惊。\n[00:45.57]A man was lying in the box on top of a pile of woollen goods. | 一个人躺在箱子里，在一堆羊毛制品上面。\n[00:52.41]He was so surprised at being discovered that he did not even try to run away. | 他被发现时非常惊讶，甚至没有试图逃跑。\n[01:00.85]After he was arrested, | 他被捕后，\n[01:03.10]the man admitted hiding in the box before the plane left London. | 这个人承认在飞机离开伦敦之前藏进了箱子里。\n[01:10.06]He had had a long and uncomfortable trip, | 他经历了一次漫长而不舒服的旅行，\n[01:14.62]for he had been confined to the wooden box for over eighteen hours. | 因为他被关在木箱里超过十八个小时。\n[01:21.89]The man was ordered to pay ￡3, 500 for the cost of the trip. | 这个人被勒令支付3,500英镑作为旅行费用。\n[01:29.89]The normal price of a ticket is ￡2, 000! | 一张机票的正常价格是2,000英镑！",
