    "lrcText": "[al:新概念英语第二册]\n[ar:山海作品推荐]\n[ti:A Thirsty Ghost]\n[by:山海作品推荐]\n[00:10.47]What evidence is there of a ghost? | 有什么证据证明有鬼？\n[00:15.82]A public house which was recently bought by Mr.Ian Thompson is up for sale. | 伊恩·汤普森先生最近购买的一家酒吧正在出售。\n[00:23.79]Mr.Thompson is going to sell it because it is haunted. | 汤普森先生打算出售它，因为它闹鬼。\n[00:29.63]He told me that he could not go to sleep one night | 他告诉我，一天晚上他无法入睡\n[00:33.59]because he heard a strange noise coming from the bar. | 因为他听到酒吧里传来奇怪的声音。\n[00:38.90]The next morning, | 第二天早上，\n[00:40.43]he found that the doors had been blocked by chairs and the furniture had been moved. | 他发现门被椅子堵住了，家具也被挪动了。\n[00:47.61]Though Mr.Thompson had turned the lights off before he went to bed, | 虽然汤普森先生睡前关了灯，\n[00:53.29]they were on in the morning. | 但早上却亮着。\n[00:56.42]He also said that he had found five empty whisky bottles | 他还说他发现了五个空威士忌酒瓶，\n[01:01.91]which the ghost must have drunk the night before. | 一定是那个鬼前一天晚上喝光的。\n[01:06.68]When I suggested that some villagers must have come | 当我暗示说一定是一些村民过来\n[01:10.57]in for a free drink, Mr.Thompson shook his head. | 免费喝酒时，汤普森先生摇了摇头。\n[01:16.52]The villagers have told him that | 村民们告诉他，\n[01:18.79]they will not accept the pub even if he gives it away. | 即使他白送，他们也不会接受那家酒吧。",
