    "lrcText": "[al:新概念英语第二册]\n[ar:山海作品推荐]\n[ti:The End of a Dream]\n[by:山海作品推荐]\n[00:11.05]How did the dream end? | 这个梦是怎样结束的呢？\n[00:15.15]Tired of sleeping on the floor, | 德黑兰有个年轻人，他睡在地板上，感到厌倦，\n[00:18.01]a young man in Teheran saved up for years to buy a real bed. | 于是积蓄了好几年，买了一张真正的床。\n[00:24.98]For the first time in his life, | 他生平第一次\n[00:28.05]he became the proud owner of a bed which had springs and a mattress. | 拥有了一张带弹簧和床垫的床，他为此感到十分自豪。\n[00:35.22]Because the weather was very hot, | 因为天气很热，\n[00:38.62]he carried the bed on to the roof of his house. | 他便把床搬到了屋顶上。\n[00:43.36]He slept very well for the first two nights, | 头两晚他睡得很好，\n[00:48.00]but on the third night, a storm blew up. | 但第三天晚上，暴风雨突然降临。\n[00:53.12]A gust of wind swept the bed off the roof and sent it crashing into the courtyard below. | 一阵狂风把床从屋顶上刮了下来，摔到了下面的院子里。\n[01:02.03]The young man did not wake up | 那个年轻人直到\n[01:04.44]until the bed had struck the ground. | 床撞到地上才醒过来。\n[01:08.46]Although the bed was smashed to pieces, | 尽管床摔成了碎片，\n[01:12.03]the man was miraculously unhurt. | 但那个人却奇迹般地没有受伤。\n[01:16.21]When he woke up, he was still on the mattress. | 他醒来时，仍然躺在床垫上。\n[01:20.84]Glancing at the bits of wood and metal that lay around him, | 他看了一眼周围的木头和金属碎片，\n[01:25.72]the man sadly picked up the mattress and carried it into his house. | 伤心地抱起床垫，把它搬进了屋里。\n[01:31.82]After he had put it on the floor, | 他把床垫放到地板上，\n[01:34.56]he promptly went to sleep again. | 便很快又睡着了。",
