    "lrcText": "[al:新概念英语第二册]\n[ar:山海作品推荐]\n[ti:Taken for a Ride]\n[by:山海作品推荐]\n[00:09.59]Why did the writer not get off the bus at Woodford Green? | 为什么作者没有在伍德福德格林下车？\n[00:16.09]I love travelling in the country, | 我喜欢在乡下旅行，\n[00:18.92]but I don't like losing my way. | 但我不喜欢迷路。\n[00:22.63]I went on an excursion recently, | 我最近去了一次短途旅行，\n[00:25.41]but my trip took me longer than I expected. | 但我的旅程比我预期的要长。\n[00:30.20]'I'm going to Woodford Green,' | “我要去伍德福德格林，”\n[00:32.63]I said to the conductor as I got on the bus, | 我上车时对售票员说，\n[00:36.84]'but I don't know where it is.' | “但我不知道它在哪里。”\n[00:40.50]'I'll tell you where to get off.' answered the conductor. | “我会告诉你哪里下车。”售票员回答。\n[00:46.00]I sat in the front of the bus to get a good view of the countryside. | 我坐在巴士前排，以便更好地欣赏乡村景色。\n[00:52.18]After some time, the bus stopped. | 过了一会儿，巴士停了下来。\n[00:55.92]Looking round, I realized with a shock that I was the only passenger left on the bus. | 我环顾四周，震惊地发现我是车上唯一的乘客了。\n[01:04.21]'You'll have to get off here,' | “你必须在这里下车，”\n[01:07.03]the conductor said. 'This is as far as we go.' | 售票员说。“我们只能到这里了。”\n[01:12.42]'Is this Woodford Green?' I asked. | “这是伍德福德格林吗？”我问道。\n[01:16.04]'Oh dear,' said the conductor suddenly. | “哦，天哪，”售票员突然说道。\n[01:20.23]'I forgot to put you off.' | “我忘了让你下车了。”\n[01:23.32]'It doesn't matter,' I said. 'I'll get off here.' | “没关系，”我说，“我就在这里下车。”\n[01:28.45]'We're going back now,' said the conductor. | “我们现在要回去了，”售票员说。\n[01:32.68]'Well, in that case, | “好吧，既然如此，”\n[01:34.90]I prefer to stay on the bus,' I answered. | 我宁愿留在车上，”我回答道。",
