    "lrcText": "[al:新概念英语第二册]\n[ar:山海作品推荐]\n[ti:Reward for Virtue]\n[by:山海作品推荐]\n[00:10.28]Why did Hugh's diet not work? | 休的节食为什么没有成功？\n[00:15.33]My friend, Hugh, has always been fat, | 我的朋友休一直很胖，\n[00:19.77]but things got so bad recently that he decided to go on a diet. | 但最近情况变得如此糟糕，以至于他决定节食。\n[00:26.32]He began his diet a week ago. | 他一周前开始节食。\n[00:29.61]First of all, he wrote out a long list of all the foods which were forbidden. | 首先，他列出了一长串所有被禁止的食物。\n[00:36.88]The list included most of the things Hugh loves: | 清单上包括了休喜欢的大部分东西：\n[00:41.30]butter, potatoes, rice, beer, milk, chocolate, and sweets. | 黄油、土豆、米饭、啤酒、牛奶、巧克力和糖果。\n[00:48.64]Yesterday I paid him a visit. | 昨天我去看望了他。\n[00:51.97]I rang the bell and was not surprised to see that Hugh was still as fat as ever. | 我按响了门铃，毫不意外地看到休仍然和以前一样胖。\n[00:59.28]He led me into his room and hurriedly hid a large parcel under his desk. | 他把我带进他的房间，然后匆忙地把一个大包裹藏到书桌下。\n[01:05.80]It was obvious that he was very embarrassed. | 显然他感到非常尴尬。\n[01:10.03]When I asked him what he was doing, | 当我问他在做什么时，\n[01:12.70]he smiled guiltily and then put the parcel on the desk. | 他内疚地笑了笑，然后把包裹放在了书桌上。\n[01:17.78]He explained that his diet was so strict that he had to reward himself occasionally. | 他解释说他的节食计划太严格了，所以他偶尔需要奖励一下自己。\n[01:25.59]Then he showed me the contents of the parcel. | 接着他给我看了包裹里的东西。\n[01:29.35]It contained five large bars of chocolate and three bags of sweets! | 里面有五大块巧克力和三袋糖果！",
