    "lrcText": "[al:新概念英语第二册]\n[ar:山海作品推荐]\n[ti:Faster Than Sound!]\n[by:山海作品推荐]\n[00:10.50]How fast did the winning car go? | 获胜的赛车开得有多快？\n[00:15.46]Once a year, a race is held for old cars. | 每年一度，都会举行一次老爷车比赛。\n[00:20.93]A lot of cars entered for this race last year and there was a great deal of excitement just before it began. | 去年，许多汽车报名参加了这场比赛，比赛开始前气氛异常热烈。\n[00:30.67]One of the most handsome cars was a Rolls-Royce Silver Ghost. | 其中一辆最漂亮的车是劳斯莱斯“银灵”。\n[00:36.65]The most unusual car was a Benz which had only three wheels. | 最不寻常的车是一辆只有三个轮子的奔驰车。\n[00:43.42]Built in 1885, it was the oldest car taking part. | 它建于1885年，是参赛车辆中最老的一辆。\n[00:50.17]After a great many loud explosions, the race began. | 在一阵阵巨大的轰鸣声之后，比赛开始了。\n[00:56.11]Many of the cars broke down on the course and some drivers spent more time under their cars than in them! | 许多汽车在赛道上抛锚了，有些司机待在车底的时间比待在车里的时间还长！\n[01:05.86]A few cars, however, completed the race. | 然而，有几辆车完成了比赛。\n[01:09.70]The winning car reached a speed of forty miles an hour -- much faster than any of its rivals. | 获胜的赛车达到了每小时40英里的速度——比任何竞争对手都要快得多。\n[01:18.47]It sped downhill at the end of the race and its driver had a lot of trouble trying to stop it. | 在比赛结束时，它向下冲刺，司机费了很大的劲才把它停下来。\n[01:26.04]The race gave everyone a great deal of pleasure. | 这场比赛给每个人带来了极大的乐趣。\n[01:30.19]It was very different from modern car races but no less exciting. | 它与现代汽车比赛大相径庭，但同样激动人心。",
