    "lrcText": "[al:新概念英语第二册]\n[ar:山海作品推荐]\n[ti:Can I Help You, Madam?]\n[by:山海作品推荐]\n[00:10.74]Did the woman get what she wanted? | 女人得到了她想要的吗？\n[00:15.08]A woman in jeans stood at the window of an expensive shop. | 一个穿着牛仔裤的女人站在一家高档商店的橱窗前。\n[00:20.60]Though she hesitated for a moment, | 尽管她犹豫了片刻，\n[00:23.77]she finally went in and asked to see a dress that was in the window. | 但她最终还是走了进去，要求看一件陈列在橱窗里的连衣裙。\n[00:30.33]The assistant who served her did not like the way she was dressed. | 接待她的店员不喜欢她的穿着打扮。\n[00:35.88]Glancing at her scornfully, he told her that the dress was sold. | 他轻蔑地瞥了她一眼，告诉她那件连衣裙已经卖掉了。\n[00:41.89]The woman walked out of the shop angrily and decided to punish the assistant next day. | 女人气愤地走出商店，决定第二天惩罚那个店员。\n[00:48.85]She returned to the shop the following morning dressed in a fur coat, | 第二天上午，她回到店里，穿了一件裘皮大衣，\n[00:54.13]with a handbag in one hand and a long umbrella in the other. | 一只手拿着坤包，另一只手拿着一把长柄伞。\n[01:00.05]After seeking out the rude assistant, | 找到那个无礼的店员后，\n[01:02.91]she asked for the same dress. | 她又问起那件连衣裙。\n[01:06.20]Not realizing who she was, the assistant was eager to serve her this time. | 店员没有认出她，这次却殷勤地为她服务。\n[01:13.81]With great difficulty, he climbed into the shop window to get the dress. | 他费了很大的劲儿才爬进橱窗去取那件连衣裙。\n[01:20.45]As soon as she saw it, the woman said she did not like it. | 她一看就说不喜欢。\n[01:26.18]She enjoyed herself making the assistant bring almost everything in the window | 她让店员把橱窗里几乎所有的东西都拿出来，\n[01:32.04]before finally buying the dress she had first asked for. | 最后才买了她第一次看中的那件连衣裙，以此来取乐。",
