    "lrcText": "[al:新概念英语第二册]\n[ar:山海作品推荐]\n[ti:The Future]\n[by:山海作品推荐]\n[00:09.35]Does what Madam Bellinsky said come true? | 贝林斯基夫人说的会成真吗？\n[00:14.66]At a village fair, I decided to visit a fortune-teller called Madam Bellinsky. | 在一个乡村集市上，我决定去拜访一位名叫贝林斯基夫人的算命师。\n[00:22.34]I went into her tent and she told me to sit down. | 我走进她的帐篷，她叫我坐下。\n[00:27.23]After I had given her some money, she looked into a crystal ball and said: | 我给了她一些钱后，她看着水晶球说：\n[00:34.11]'A relation of yours is coming to see you. | “你的一位亲戚要来看你。\n[00:38.29]She will be arriving this evening and intends to stay for a few days. | 她今晚会到，打算住几天。\n[00:44.40]The moment you leave this tent, you will get a big surprise. | 你一离开这个帐篷，就会有一个大惊喜。\n[00:49.83]A woman you know well will rush towards you. | 一位你很熟悉的女人会向你跑来。\n[00:54.18]She will speak to you and then she will lead you away from this place. That is all.' | 她会和你说话，然后带你离开这个地方。就这些了。”\n[01:02.40]As soon as I went outside, I forgot all about Madam Bellinsky because my wife hurried towards me. | 我一出去，就完全把贝林斯基夫人忘在脑后了，因为我妻子匆匆向我走来。\n[01:11.48]'Where have you been hiding?' she asked impatiently. | “你躲到哪里去了？”她不耐烦地问。\n[01:16.83]'Your sister will be here in less than an hour and we must be at the station to meet her. We are late already.' | “你妹妹不到一小时就要到了，我们必须去车站接她。我们已经迟到了。”\n[01:26.58]As she walked away, I followed her out of the fair. | 她走开时，我跟着她离开了集市。",
