    "lrcText": "[al:新概念英语第二册]\n[ar:山海作品推荐]\n[ti:After the Fire]\n[by:山海作品推荐]\n[00:10.30]What was the danger to the villages after the fire? | 火灾过后，村庄面临的危险是什么？\n[00:16.43]Firemen had been fighting the forest fire for nearly three weeks before they could get it under control. | 消防队员们同那场森林大火搏斗了将近3个星期才把火势控制住。\n[00:24.71]A short time before, great trees had covered the countryside for miles around. | 不久前，大树还覆盖着周围几英里长的乡村。\n[00:32.82]Now, smoke still rose up from the warm ground over the desolate hills. | 如今，烟雾依然从荒凉山丘的温暖地面上冉冉升起。\n[00:40.73]Winter was coming on and the hills threatened the surrounding villages with destruction, | 冬天快到了，这些山丘威胁着周围的村庄，要将它们毁灭，\n[00:48.68]for heavy rain would not only wash away the soil but would cause serious floods as well. | 因为大雨不仅会冲走泥土，还会引起严重的水灾。\n[00:56.96]When the fire had at last been put out, | 大火最终被扑灭后，\n[01:00.53]the forest authorities ordered several tons of a special type of grass-seed which would grow quickly. | 森林管理机构订购了几吨很快就能生长的特殊草籽。\n[01:08.80]The seed was sprayed over the ground in huge quantities by aeroplanes. | 草籽由飞机大量地撒向地面。\n[01:15.84]The planes had been planting seed for nearly a month when it began to rain. | 飞机撒播草籽将近一个月后，天下起了雨。\n[01:21.84]By then, however, in many places the grass had already taken root. | 然而，到那时许多地方的草已经生根了。\n[01:28.38]In place of the great trees which had been growing there for centuries, | 原本在那里生长了几个世纪的大树，\n[01:33.66]patches of green had begun to appear in the blackened soil. | 如今在焦黑的泥土上开始出现一片片绿色。",
