    "lrcText": "[al:新概念英语第二册]\n[ar:山海作品推荐]\n[ti:She Was Not Amused]\n[by:山海作品推荐]\n[00:11.28]Why did Jenny want to leave the wedding reception? | 珍妮为什么想离开婚宴？\n[00:16.80]Jeremy Hampden has a large circle of friends and is very popular at parties. | 杰里米·汉普顿交友甚广，在聚会上很受欢迎。\n[00:24.20]Everybody admires him for his great sense of humour--everybody, that is, except his six-year-old daughter, Jenny. | 人人都羡慕他那绝妙的幽默感——人人都羡慕，除了他六岁的女儿珍妮。\n[00:34.85]Recently, one of Jeremy's closest friends asked him to make a speech at a wedding reception. | 最近，杰里米的一位最亲密的朋友请他在一个婚宴上讲话。\n[00:43.10]This is the sort of thing that Jeremy loves. | 这正是杰里米喜欢做的事情。\n[00:47.35]He prepared the speech carefully and went to the wedding with Jenny. | 他精心准备了演讲稿，并和珍妮一起去了婚礼。\n[00:52.84]He had included a large number of funny stories in the speech and, of course, it was a great success. | 他在演讲中讲了许多有趣的故事，当然，演讲非常成功。\n[01:01.52]As soon as he had finished Jenny told him she wanted to go home. | 演讲刚一结束，珍妮就告诉他她想回家。\n[01:08.38]Jeremy was a little disappointed by this but he did as his daughter asked. | 杰里米对此有点失望，但他还是照他女儿的要求做了。\n[01:14.98]On the way home, he asked Jenny if she had enjoyed the speech. | 在回家的路上，他问珍妮是否喜欢那个演讲。\n[01:21.03]To his surprise she said she hadn't. | 令他惊讶的是，她说她不喜欢。\n[01:25.10]Jeremy asked her why this was so and she told him that she did not like to see so many people laughing at him! | 杰里米问她为什么不喜欢，她告诉他她不喜欢看到那么多人嘲笑他！",
