    "lrcText": "[al:新概念英语第二册]\n[ar:山海作品推荐]\n[ti:Sweet as Honey]\n[by:山海作品推荐]\n[00:10.69]What was 'sweet as honey' and why? | 什么是“甜如蜂蜜”以及为什么？\n[00:16.04]In 1963 a Lancaster bomber crashed on Wallis Island, | 1963年，一架兰开斯特轰炸机坠毁在沃利斯岛，\n[00:22.41]a remote place in the South Pacific, a long way west of Samoa. | 一个位于南太平洋的偏远地方，在萨摩亚以西很远。\n[00:28.60]The plane wasn't too badly damaged, | 飞机没有损坏得太严重，\n[00:31.61]but over the years the crash was forgotten and the wreck remained undisturbed. | 但多年来，这次坠机事件被遗忘，残骸也一直未被触动。\n[00:38.58]Then in 1989, twenty-six years after the crash, the plane was accidentally rediscovered in an aerial survey of the island. | 1989年，坠机26年后，在一项对该岛的空中勘测中，这架飞机被意外重新发现。\n[00:51.34]By this time, a Lancaster bomber in reasonable condition was rare and worth rescuing. | 此时，一架状况尚可的兰开斯特轰炸机已属罕见，值得营救。\n[00:59.89]The French authorities had the plane packaged and moved in parts back to France. | 法国当局将飞机打包，并分批运回法国。\n[01:06.28]Now a group of enthusiasts are going to have the plane restored. | 现在，一群爱好者正准备修复这架飞机。\n[01:11.64]It has four Rolls-Royce Merlin engines but the group will need to have only three of them rebuilt. | 它有四台劳斯莱斯梅林发动机，但该团队只需要重建其中三台。\n[01:20.44]Imagine their surprise and delight when they broke open the packing cases | 想象一下，当他们打开包装箱时，是多么惊喜和高兴，\n[01:26.63]and found that the fourth engine was sweet as honey--still in perfect condition. | 发现第四台发动机“甜如蜂蜜”——仍然处于完美状态。\n[01:34.21]A colony of bees had turned the engine into a hive and it was totally preserved in beeswax! | 一群蜜蜂把发动机变成了一个蜂巢，它完全被蜂蜡保存了下来！",
