    "id": "us/NCE2/81.Escape",
    "book": "us",
    "group": "NCE2",
    "filename": "NCE2/81.Escape",
    "title": "Escape",
    "audioUrl": "NCE/NCE2/81.Escape.mp3",
    "lrcUrl": "NCE/NCE2/81.Escape.lrc",
    "lrcText": "[al:新概念英语第二册]\n[ar:山海作品推荐]\n[ti:Escape]\n[by:山海作品推荐]\n[00:09.76]Why did the prisoner attack the driver? | 囚犯为什么要袭击司机？\n[00:14.72]When he had killed the guard, the prisoner of war quickly dragged him into the bushes. | 杀死看守后，这名战俘迅速将他拖进了灌木丛。\n[00:22.17]Working rapidly in the darkness, he soon changed into the dead man's clothes. | 在黑暗中迅速行动，他很快换上了死人的衣服。\n[00:29.11]Now, dressed in a blue uniform and with a rifle over his shoulder, | 现在，他身穿蓝色制服，肩上扛着一支步枪，\n[00:35.61]the prisoner marched boldly up and down in front of the camp. | 这名囚犯大胆地在营地前走来走去。\n[00:40.97]He could hear shouting in the camp itself. | 他能听到营地里传来喊叫声。\n[00:44.53]Lights were blazing and men were running here and there: they had just discovered that a prisoner had escaped. | 灯火通明，人们四处奔跑：他们刚刚发现一名囚犯越狱了。\n[00:54.19]At that moment, a large black car with four officers inside it, stopped at the camp gates. | 就在这时，一辆载有四名军官的黑色轿车在营地大门前停了下来。\n[01:03.80]The officers got out and the prisoner stood to attention and saluted as they passed. | 军官们下了车，囚犯立正向他们敬礼。\n[01:11.43]When they had gone the driver of the car came towards him. | 他们走后，轿车司机朝他走来。\n[01:16.65]The man obviously wanted to talk. | 那个人显然想说话。\n[01:20.28]He was rather elderly with grey hair and clear blue eyes. | 他年纪相当大，头发灰白，眼睛湛蓝清澈。\n[01:25.90]The prisoner felt sorry for him, but there was nothing else he could do. | 囚犯为他感到抱歉，但他别无选择。\n[01:32.48]As the man came near the prisoner knocked him to the ground with a sharp blow. | 那人走近时，囚犯一记重击将他打倒在地。\n[01:39.66]Then, jumping into the car, he drove off as quickly as he could. | 然后，他跳进车里，以最快的速度开走了。",
