    "id": "us/NCE2/83.After the Elections",
    "book": "us",
    "group": "NCE2",
    "filename": "NCE2/83.After the Elections",
    "title": "After the Elections",
    "audioUrl": "NCE/NCE2/83.After the Elections.mp3",
    "lrcUrl": "NCE/NCE2/83.After the Elections.lrc",
    "lrcText": "[al:新概念英语第二册]\n[ar:山海作品推荐]\n[ti:After the Elections]\n[by:山海作品推荐]\n[00:10.65]Why did Patrick keep on asking the same question? | 帕特里克为什么一直问同一个问题？\n[00:16.90]The former Prime Minister, Mr. Wentworth Lane, was defeated in the recent elections. | 前首相温特沃斯·莱恩先生在最近的选举中失利。\n[00:24.64]He is now retiring from political life and has gone abroad. | 他现在正退出政坛，并且已经出国了。\n[00:30.50]My friend, Patrick, has always been a fanatical opponent of Mr. Lane's Radical Progressive Party. | 我的朋友帕特里克一直是莱恩先生激进进步党的狂热反对者。\n[00:39.87]After the elections, Patrick went to the former Prime Minister's house. | 选举结束后，帕特里克去了前首相的家。\n[00:46.36]When he asked if Mr. Lane lived there, the policeman on duty told him that since his defeat, the ex-Prime Minister had gone abroad. | 当他问莱恩先生是否住在那儿时，值班警察告诉他，自从失利后，这位前首相就出国了。\n[00:58.53]On the following day Patrick went to the house again. | 第二天，帕特里克又去了那所房子。\n[01:03.77]The same policeman was just walking slowly past the entrance, when Patrick asked the same question. | 还是那个警察，他正慢慢地走过入口，这时帕特里克又问了同样的问题。\n[01:12.83]Though a little suspicious this time the policeman gave him the same answer. | 尽管这次有些怀疑，警察还是给了他同样的答案。\n[01:20.10]The day after, Patrick went to the house once more and asked exactly the same question. | 第二天，帕特里克又一次去了那所房子，问了完全相同的问题。\n[01:29.64]This time, the policeman lost his temper. | 这次，警察发火了。\n[01:34.34]'I told you yesterday and the day before yesterday,' he shouted, | “我昨天和前天都告诉你了，”他喊道，\n[01:41.65]'Mr.Lane was defeated in the elections. | “莱恩先生在选举中失利了。\n[01:45.66]He has retired from political life and gone to live abroad!' | 他已经退出政坛并出国定居了！”\n[01:52.00]'I know,' answered Patrick,' but I love to hear you say it!' | “我知道，”帕特里克回答说，“但我喜欢听你说！”",
    "hasAudio": true,
    "hasLrc": true,
    "source": "default"
