    "lrcText": "[al:新概念英语第二册]\n[ar:山海作品推荐]\n[ti:Out of Control]\n[by:山海作品推荐]\n[00:10.76]What was the danger? | 危险是什么？\n[00:14.45]As the man tried to swing the speedboat round, the steering wheel came away in his hands. | 当那人试图把快艇转弯时，方向盘脱落在他手中。\n[00:22.55]He waved desperately to his companion, who had been water skiing for the last fifteen minutes. | 他绝望地向他的同伴挥手，他的同伴在过去的15分钟里一直在滑水。\n[00:30.82]Both men had hardly had time to realize what was happening when they were thrown violently into the sea. | 两名男子还没来得及意识到发生了什么，就被猛地甩进海里。\n[00:40.90]The speedboat had struck a buoy, but it continued to move very quickly across the water. | 快艇撞上了一个浮标，但它仍然在水面上快速行驶。\n[00:49.20]Both men had just begun to swim towards the shore, | 两名男子刚开始向岸边游去，\n[00:53.93]when they noticed with dismay that the speedboat was moving in a circle. | 却沮丧地发现快艇正在画圈行驶。\n[01:00.07]It now came straight towards them at tremendous speed. | 它现在以惊人的速度径直朝他们冲来。\n[01:05.95]In less than a minute, it roared past them only a few feet away. | 不到一分钟，它咆哮着从他们身边几英尺的地方冲过。\n[01:13.18]After it had passed, they swam on as quickly as they could because they knew that the boat would soon return. | 快艇驶过之后，他们尽力快速向前游，因为他们知道快艇很快就会回来。\n[01:23.52]They had just had enough time to swim out of danger when the boat again completed a circle. | 他们刚来得及游出危险区域，快艇又完成了一圈。\n[01:32.13]On this occasion, however, it had slowed down considerably. | 然而，这一次，它已经明显减速了。\n[01:38.41]The petrol had nearly all been used up. | 汽油差不多用完了。\n[01:42.60]Before long, the noise dropped completely and the boat began to drift gently across the water. | 不久，噪音完全消失了，快艇开始在水面上轻轻地漂浮。",
