    "id": "us/NCE3/20.Pioneer Pilots",
    "book": "us",
    "group": "NCE3",
    "filename": "NCE3/20.Pioneer Pilots",
    "title": "Pioneer Pilots",
    "audioUrl": "NCE/NCE3/20.Pioneer Pilots.mp3",
    "lrcUrl": "NCE/NCE3/20.Pioneer Pilots.lrc",
    "lrcText": "[al:新概念英语第三册]\n[ar:山海作品推荐]\n[ti:Pioneer Pilots]\n[by:山海作品推荐]\n[00:00.25]Lesson 20 | 第20课\n[00:02.10]Pioneer pilots | 拓荒飞行员\n[00:09.15]What was the name of the first plane to fly across the English Channel? | 第一架飞越英吉利海峡的飞机叫什么名字？\n[00:15.81]In 1908 Lord Northcliffe offered a prize of ￡1, 000 to the first man who would fly across the English Channel. | 1908年，诺思克利夫勋爵悬赏1000英镑，奖给第一位飞越英吉利海峡的人。\n[00:26.78]Over a year passed before the first attempt was made. | 一年多过去了，才有人首次尝试。\n[00:31.28]On July 19th, 1909, in the early morning, | 1909年7月19日清晨，\n[00:36.36]Hubert Latham took off from the French coast in his plane the 'Antoinette IV.' | 休伯特·拉瑟姆驾驶他的“安托瓦内特四号”飞机从法国海岸起飞。\n[00:43.14]He had travelled only seven miles across the Channel when his engine failed and he was forced to land on the sea. | 他飞越海峡仅七英里，发动机就失灵了，被迫降落在海面上。\n[00:52.26]The 'Antoinette' floated on the water until Latham was picked up by a ship. | “安托瓦内特”号浮在水面，直到拉瑟姆被一艘船救起。\n[00:59.22]Two days later, Louis Bleriot arrived near Calais with a plane called 'No.XI'. | 两天后，路易·布莱里奥带着一架名叫“十一号”的飞机抵达加来附近。\n[01:07.16]Bleriot had been making planes since 1905 and this was his latest model. | 布莱里奥自1905年起就在制造飞机，这是他的最新型号。\n[01:14.33]A week before, he had completed a successful overland flight during which he covered twenty-six miles. | 一周前，他成功完成了一次陆上飞行，飞行距离达二十六英里。\n[01:22.54]Latham, however, did not give up easily. | 然而，拉瑟姆并没有轻易放弃。\n[01:25.76]He, too, arrived near Calais on the same day with a new 'Antoinette'. | 他也在同一天带着一架新的“安托瓦内特”号抵达加来附近。\n[01:32.20]It looked as if there would be an exciting race across the Channel. | 看来将有一场激动人心的跨海峡比赛。\n[01:37.19]Both planes were going to take off on July 25th, but Latham failed to get up early enough. | 两架飞机都准备在7月25日起飞，但拉瑟姆未能足够早地起床。\n[01:45.05]After making a short test flight at 4.15 a.m., Bleriot set off half an hour later. | 在凌晨4点15分进行了一次短程试飞后，布莱里奥在半小时后出发了。\n[01:53.10]His great flight lasted thirty-seven minutes. | 他这次伟大的飞行持续了三十七分钟。\n[01:56.90]When he landed near Dover, the first person to greet him was a local policeman. | 当他在多佛附近着陆时，第一个迎接他的是一位当地警察。\n[02:03.67]Latham made another attempt a week later and got within half a mile of Dover, | 一周后，拉瑟姆又进行了一次尝试，到达了离多佛半英里以内的地方，\n[02:09.34]but he was unlucky again. | 但他再次不幸。\n[02:11.85]His engine failed and he landed on the sea for the second time. | 他的发动机失灵了，他第二次降落在海面上。",
    "hasAudio": true,
    "hasLrc": true,
    "source": "default"
